# ~/.secrets/config/env/shell.env — non-secret interactive shell settings only
# Copy here with mode 600, then run make link. ~/.secrets/env.sh links here.
# Store credentials in macOS Keychain; use on-demand dotfiles loaders.
# Do not retrieve Keychain credentials or export tokens during shell startup.
# Per-tool config/env/*.env files contain settings and keychain://service references.
# See README: Keychain-first credentials (Mac).
